Changes in this copy: the [META] and [USER] sections were removed (the node sends the request as
the user message); the aspect ratio is read from the request text instead of a separate input; a
dangling section reference was corrected; a section on JSON drafts as input was added; and rules
for the node's keep-words note, adult subjects and a final format check were added at the end.
